OL,3,GNEWSA'Strongwomen are trying to grow
OL,4,Athe sport's visibility'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Viv Taylor's personal trainer
OL,7,Fencouraged her to start focusing on
OL,8,Fstrength training she worried lifting
OL,9,Fheavier weights would affect her
OL,10,Fphysique.
OL,12,FAs a Crossfit devotee, the now
OL,13,F43-year-old, from York, says she
OL,14,Fcouldn't have imagined her first
OL,15,F"thruster" - a squat, push and press
OL,16,Fexercise with dumbbells - would
OL,17,Feventually lead to her setting a new
OL,18,Fcompetition record.
OL,20,F"I felt like it was a whole world I had
OL,21,Fno idea about," Viv explains.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
